uld like  things that would state that he is going  to be kingpin in the mcu that was his  sort of subtle way of telling us yes you  are right i'm coming back i can't say it  but i am so perhaps this could be norman  reedus's way of telling us yes you're  right i have been cast as ghost writer i  will be playing ghost rider in the mcu i  can't tell you but i am and if this is  the case if this is true let me know  what you think about this casting in the  comments down below do you like this do  you not like this if you don't like this  who else did you have in mind let me  know down below don't forget to like the  video and subscribe so you can stay up  to date on all the latest mcu news for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof  you

